It is the month of March now.
It is getting very hot in Mumbai now.
Summer is coming in Mumbai.
It is morning time.
I get ready for the office.
I take out my clothes from the cupboard.
I choose a thick blue jeans.
I usually wear jeans to the office.
I put on that thick jeans.
And I put on a black t-shirt.
But I immediately feel very hot.
This blue jeans is very thick.
This black t-shirt is also warm.
These clothes are not good for the summer.
I want light clothes.
I want cotton clothes.
I take off that thick jeans.
I wear a simple cotton dress today.
I want new cotton clothes.
This evening I go to a clothing shop.
